                                                "sense_id": "1f5cf334-0931-3117-b802-660c6c6f7849",
                                                "text": "In their spare moments the animals would walk round and round the half-finished mill, admiring the strength and perpendicularity of its walls and marvelling that they should ever have been able to build anything so imposing."
